      "arabic_text": "عَنْهُ عَنْ عَلِيٍّ عَنْ أَبِيهِ عَنْ إِسْمَاعِيلَ بْنِ مَرَّارٍ عَنْ يُونُسَ عَنْ مُعَاوِيَةَ بْنِ عَمَّارٍ عَنْ أَبِي عَبْدِ اللَّهِ ع قَالَ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "From him, from Ali, from his father, from Isma'il ibn Marar, from Yunus, from Mu'awiya ibn 'Ammar, from Abu Abdillah (peace be upon him) who said:"
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "مَنْ حَجَّ فَلْيَتَمَّتَعْ فَإِنَّا لَا نَعْدِلُ بِكِتَابِ اللَّهِ وَ سُنَّةِ نَبِيِّهِ ص",
      "translations": {
        "en": "Whoever performs Hajj, let him perform Tamattu', for we do not consider anything equal to the Book of Allah and the Sunnah of His Prophet (peace be upon him and his family)."
      }
    }
  ],
